{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Edom shall be a possession.</b> For the beasts and birds of the wilderness, as it says: וִירֵשׁוּהָ קָאַת וְקִפּוֹד (Isaiah 34:11)." "<b>And Seir shall be a possession.</b> For Israel, for it includes the Kenite, Kenizzite, and Kadmonite." "<b>His enemies.</b> And the reason that vengeance shall be taken upon Moab and Edom more than upon the other nations, is that they have always been the enemies of Israel." "<b>And Israel does valiantly.</b> Then Israel shall be able to do valiantly, as it says: וּלְאֹם מִלְאֹם יֶאֱמָץ (Genesis 25:23)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:04.048596300Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}